# Vue Single File Components (SFC)

## Block order

Always place `<template>` first in every Vue SFC, followed by `<script>`, followed by `<style>`:

1. `<template>` - Component markup and structure
2. `<script setup lang="ts">` - Component logic and composition
3. `<style scoped>` - Component styles (when present)

### Standard template layout

```vue
<template>
  <div>
    <!-- markup -->
  </div>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
// logic
</script>

<style scoped>
/* styles */
</style>
```

Never place `<script>` before `<template>`.
